The new SETUP-01 bindings exercise real commit-lint functions and Git histories. The browser bindings drive Chromium against the built dashboard and API; the response-derived-counts scenario deliberately substitutes its findings response. The outstanding blockers concern GT-02’s reproducibility and reconciliation.
